@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Scan QR Presensi Siswa (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary View as V
control Controller as C
entity Model as M
boundary "Camera API" as CAM

== Akses Halaman QR Presensi ==

TU -> V: 1. Akses Dashboard
V --> TU: Tampilkan Dashboard

TU -> V: 2. Pilih "Presensi Siswa" > "Scan QR Presensi"
V -> C: Handle navigation
C -> M: Get school schedule & current time
M --> C: Return time data
C -> V: Load QR scan page
V --> TU: Tampilkan halaman QR Presensi

== Proses Scan QR ==

TU -> V: 3. Tekan "Mulai Pemindaian"
V -> C: Handle scan request
C -> CAM: Request camera permission

alt Camera Permission Granted
    CAM --> C: Permission granted
    C -> V: Initialize camera
    V -> CAM: Activate camera
    CAM --> V: Camera ready
    V --> TU: Tampilkan interface kamera
    
    TU -> V: 4. Arahkan kamera ke QR Code siswa
    V -> CAM: Capture QR code
    CAM --> V: QR data detected
    V -> C: Process QR data
    
    C -> M: Validate QR & get student data
    M --> C: Return validation result
    
    alt Valid QR Code
        C -> M: Check time & record attendance
        
        alt Waktu Normal (Sebelum jam masuk)
            M --> C: Status "Hadir" recorded
            C -> V: Show success
            V --> TU: "Presensi berhasil - Status: Hadir"
            
        else Terlambat (Setelah jam masuk)
            M --> C: Status "Terlambat" recorded
            C -> V: Show success
            V --> TU: "Presensi berhasil - Status: Terlambat"
            
        else Di Luar Jam Operasional
            M --> C: Time validation failed
            C -> V: Show error
            V --> TU: "Presensi tidak dapat dijalankan"
        end
        
    else Invalid QR Code
        M --> C: Invalid student data
        C -> V: Show error
        V --> TU: "QR Code tidak valid"
    end
    
    group After Successful Scan
        C -> M: Get updated attendance summary
        M --> C: Return attendance data
        C -> V: Update display & reset camera
        V --> TU: Tampilkan ringkasan + siap scan berikutnya
    end
    
else Camera Permission Denied
    CAM --> C: Permission denied
    C -> V: Show permission error
    V --> TU: "Izin kamera diperlukan untuk scan"
end

note over TU, M
**Pre-kondisi:**
- Tata Usaha login di dashboard
- Siswa terdaftar dalam sistem

**Post-kondisi:**
- Data kehadiran siswa tercatat dengan status:
  * "Hadir" - scan sebelum jam masuk
  * "Terlambat" - scan setelah jam masuk
  * Error - scan di luar jam operasional

**Validasi:**
- QR Code harus valid dan terdaftar
- Waktu scan dalam jam operasional sekolah
- Camera permission diperlukan
end note

@enduml